ener nofollow\">Studious</a><br>\nTwin to <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Judicious Ackord\" data-href=\"Judicious Ackord\" href=\"characters/npcs/judicious-ackord.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Judicious</a><br>\nUncle to <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Steadfast of the Ackord - The Judge\" data-href=\"Steadfast of the Ackord - The Judge\" href=\"characters/steadfast-of-the-ackord-the-judge.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Steady</a> and <a data-href=\"Worthy Ackord\" href=\"characters/npcs/worthy-ackord.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Worthy Ackord</a>Married.\nHis wife recently gave birth to their third son.<br>His judgement of <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Lenox Fyle - The Marshal\" data-href=\"Lenox Fyle - The Marshal\" href=\"characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Lenox</a> and his gang, the Grateful, was considered lenient.","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[{"heading":"Relations","level":2,"id":"Relations_0"},{"heading":"Family","level":3,"id":"Family_0"},{"heading":"Other","level":3,"id":"Other_0"}],"links":["characters/npcs/studious-ackord-(dead).html","characters/npcs/judicious-ackord.html","characters/steadfast-of-the-ackord-the-judge.html","characters/npcs/worthy-ackord.html","characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html"],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"characters/npcs/magistrate-ackord.html","pathToRoot":"../..","attachments":[],"createdTime":1794267170133,"modifiedTime":1794267580334,"sourceSize":437,"sourcePath":"Characters/NPCs/Magistrate Ackord.md","exportPath":"characters/npcs/magistrate-ackord.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":4,"backlinks":["characters/npcs/studious-ackord-(dead).html","characters/steadfast-of-the-ackord-the-judge.html"],"type":"markdown"},"characters/npcs/studious-ackord-(dead).html":{"title":"Studious Ackord (Dead)","icon":"","description":"Judge, Chronicler in his day.father to <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Magistrate Ackord\" data-href=\"Magistrate Ackord\" href=\"characters/npcs/magistrate-ackord.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Magistrate</a> and <a data-href=\"Judicious Ackord\" href=\"characters/npcs/judicious-ackord.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Judicious Ackord</a>","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[{"heading":"Relations","level":2,"id":"Relations_0"}],"links":["characters/npcs/magistrate-ackord.html","characters/npcs/judicious-ackord.html"],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"characters/npcs/studious-ackord-(dead).html","pathToRoot":"../..","attachments":[],"createdTime":1794267154926,"modifiedTime":1794267286429,"sourceSize":111,"sourcePath":"Characters/NPCs/Studious Ackord (Dead).md","exportPath":"characters/npcs/studious-ackord-(dead).html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":5,"backlinks":["characters/npcs/judicious-ackord.html","characters/npcs/magistrate-ackord.html"],"type":"markdown"},"characters/npcs/the-grateful.html":{"title":"The Grateful","icon":"","description":"Lygosi drug smugglers who came to the edge of the world thinking they'd set themselves up as kingpins. Ended up using up their own supply and saved by the kindness of Stonetop.Eager, gullible\nMisses their familyLittle, animal lover\nMissing finger, scarsNaive, kind\nRecently married, skinnyRookie, big\nWhistles, whittlesBig, Reckless\nRed in the face, sings, snoresProud, popular\nReliable, too seriousLed by <a data-href=\"Lenox Fyle - The Marshal\" href=\"characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Lenox Fyle - The Marshal</a>","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[{"heading":"Ticky","level":1,"id":"Ticky_0"},{"heading":"Beansy","level":1,"id":"Beansy_0"},{"heading":"Dusty","level":1,"id":"Dusty_0"},{"heading":"Fritz","level":1,"id":"Fritz_0"},{"heading":"Plum","level":1,"id":"Plum_0"},{"heading":"Longfellow","level":1,"id":"Longfellow_0"},{"heading":"Relations","level":2,"id":"Relations_0"}],"links":["characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html"],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"characters/npcs/the-grateful.html","pathToRoot":"../..","attachments":[],"createdTime":1794269594474,"modifiedTime":1794269795571,"sourceSize":516,"sourcePath":"Characters/NPCs/The Grateful.md","exportPath":"characters/npcs/the-grateful.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":6,"backlinks":["characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html","characters/river-the-blessed.html"],"type":"markdown"},"characters/npcs/worthy-ackord.html":{"title":"Worthy Ackord","icon":"","description":"Son of <a data-href=\"Judicious Ackord\" href=\"characters/npcs/judicious-ackord.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Judicious Ackord</a>.<br>\nBrother to <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Steadfast of the Ackord - The Judge\" data-href=\"Steadfast of the Ackord - The Judge\" href=\"characters/steadfast-of-the-ackord-the-judge.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Steady</a>. Younger by 13 years.His twin and mother died during his birth.<br>His best friend's death is blamed on the actions of <a data-href=\"Lenox Fyle - The Marshal\" href=\"characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Lenox Fyle - The Marshal</a>","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[{"heading":"Relations","level":2,"id":"Relations_0"}],"links":["characters/npcs/judicious-ackord.html","characters/steadfast-of-the-ackord-the-judge.html","characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html"],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"characters/npcs/worthy-ackord.html","pathToRoot":"../..","attachments":[],"createdTime":1794267408254,"modifiedTime":1794267504862,"sourceSize":248,"sourcePath":"Characters/NPCs/Worthy Ackord.md","exportPath":"characters/npcs/worthy-ackord.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":7,"backlinks":["characters/npcs/judicious-ackord.html","characters/npcs/magistrate-ackord.html","characters/steadfast-of-the-ackord-the-judge.html"],"type":"markdown"},"characters/aurelia-senka-the-lightbearer.html":{"title":"Aurelia Senka - The Lightbearer","icon":"","description":"<a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://hearthfire.camp/game/ThPTrnJaqcaPVYg6UcjL/lightbearer\" target=\"_self\">https://hearthfire.camp/game/ThPTrnJaqcaPVYg6UcjL/lightbearer</a><br>Daughter to <a data-href=\"Golenthi Senka (Dead)\" href=\"characters/npcs/golenthi-senka-(dead).html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Golenthi Senka (Dead)</a><br>Crosses paths with <a data-href=\"River - The Blessed\" href=\"characters/river-the-blessed.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">River - The Blessed</a> when they both wander the vicinity of Stonetop.","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[{"heading":"Relations","level":2,"id":"Relations_0"},{"heading":"Family","level":3,"id":"Family_0"},{"heading":"Other","level":3,"id":"Other_0"}],"links":["characters/npcs/golenthi-senka-(dead).html","characters/river-the-blessed.html"],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"characters/aurelia-senka-the-lightbearer.html","pathToRoot":"..","attachments":[],"createdTime":1794266680014,"modifiedTime":1794268347555,"sourceSize":227,"sourcePath":"Characters/Aurelia Senka - The Lightbearer.md","exportPath":"characters/aurelia-senka-the-lightbearer.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":8,"backlinks":["characters/npcs/golenthi-senka-(dead).html","characters/river-the-blessed.html"],"type":"markdown"},"characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html":{"title":"Lenox Fyle - The Marshal","icon":"","description":"<a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://hearthfire.camp/game/ThPTrnJaqcaPVYg6UcjL/marshal\" target=\"_self\">https://hearthfire.camp/game/ThPTrnJaqcaPVYg6UcjL/marshal</a><br>Leader of <a data-href=\"The Grateful\" href=\"characters/npcs/the-grateful.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">The Grateful</a>, a band of penitent smugglers from Lygos turned Stonetop militia.<br><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"River - The Blessed\" data-href=\"River - The Blessed\" href=\"characters/river-the-blessed.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">River</a> left food for the Lenox and the Grateful when the citizens of Stonetop nursed them through withdrawals.","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[{"heading":"Relations","level":2,"id":"Relations_0"}],"links":["characters/npcs/the-grateful.html","characters/river-the-blessed.html"],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html","pathToRoot":"..","attachments":[],"createdTime":1794266878504,"modifiedTime":1794269202623,"sourceSize":299,"sourcePath":"Characters/Lenox Fyle - The Marshal.md","exportPath":"characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":9,"backlinks":["characters/npcs/magistrate-ackord.html","characters/npcs/the-grateful.html","characters/npcs/worthy-ackord.html","characters/river-the-blessed.html"],"type":"markdown"},"characters/river-the-blessed.html":{"title":"River - The Blessed","icon":"","description":"River's parents were humans living among the Forest Folk. One stormy night when she was a child, they went out and never returned.River remembers <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Shep Marlowe - The Heavy\" data-href=\"Shep Marlowe - The Heavy\" href=\"characters/shep-marlowe-the-heavy.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Shep</a> being kind to her when she arrived in Stonetop an orphan. She was the first there for him when he returned from his violent exploits.<br>Crosses paths with <a data-href=\"Aurelia Senka - The Lightbearer\" href=\"characters/aurelia-senka-the-lightbearer.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Aurelia Senka - The Lightbearer</a> when they both wander in the vicinity of Stonetop.<br>Left food for <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Lenox Fyle - The Marshal\" data-href=\"Lenox Fyle - The Marshal\" href=\"characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Lenox</a> and <a data-href=\"The Grateful\" href=\"characters/npcs/the-grateful.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">The Grateful</a> while they were in the midst of <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"Otash\" data-href=\"Otash\" href=\"things/otash.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">otash</a> withdrawals.","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[{"heading":"Relations","level":2,"id":"Relations_0"},{"heading":"Family","level":3,"id":"Family_0"},{"heading":"Other","level":3,"id":"Other_0"}],"links":["characters/shep-marlowe-the-heavy.html","characters/aurelia-senka-the-lightbearer.html","characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html","characters/npcs/the-grateful.html","things/otash.html"],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"characters/river-the-blessed.html","pathToRoot":"..","attachments":[],"createdTime":1794266878504,"modifiedTime":1794269524483,"sourceSize":588,"sourcePath":"Characters/River - The Blessed.md","exportPath":"characters/river-the-blessed.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":10,"backlinks":["characters/aurelia-senka-the-lightbearer.html","characters/lenox-fyle-the-marshal.html"],"type":"markdown"},"characters/ryland-windbane-the-fox.html":{"title":"Ryland Windbane - The Fox","icon":"","description":"","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[],"links":[],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"characters/ryland-windbane-the-fox.html","pathToRoot":"..","attachments":[],"createdTime":1794266878504,"modifiedTime":1794266924515,"sourceSize":0,"sourcePath":"Characters/Ryland Windbane - The Fox.md","exportPath":"characters/ryland-windbane-the-fox.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":11,"backlinks":[],"type":"markdown"},"characters/shep-marlowe-the-heavy.html":{"title":"Shep Marlowe - The Heavy","icon":"","description":"","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[],"links":[],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"characters/shep-marlowe-the-heavy.html","pathToRoot":"..","attachments":[],"createdTime":1794266878504,"modifiedTime":1794266934322,"sourceSize":0,"sourcePath":"Characters/Shep Marlowe - The Heavy.md","exportPath":"characters/shep-marlowe-the-heavy.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":12,"backlinks":["characters/river-the-blessed.html"],"type":"markdown"},"characters/steadfast-of-the-ackord-the-judge.html":{"title":"Steadfast of the Ackord - The Judge","icon":"","description":"<a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://hearthfire.camp/game/ThPTrnJaqcaPVYg6UcjL/judge\" target=\"_self\">https://hearthfire.camp/game/ThPTrnJaqcaPVYg6UcjL/judge</a><br>Daughter to <a data-href=\"Judicious Ackord\" href=\"characters/npcs/judicious-ackord.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Judicious Ackord</a><br>\nNiece to <a data-href=\"Magistrate Ackord\" href=\"characters/npcs/magistrate-ackord.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Magistrate Ackord</a><br>\nSister to <a data-href=\"Worthy Ackord\" href=\"characters/npcs/worthy-ackord.html\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Worthy Ackord</a>","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[{"heading":"Relationships","level":3,"id":"Relationships_0"}],"links":["characters/npcs/judicious-ackord.html","characters/npcs/magistrate-ackord.html","characters/npcs/worthy-ackord.html"],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"characters/steadfast-of-the-ackord-the-judge.html","pathToRoot":"..","attachments":[],"createdTime":1794266878504,"modifiedTime":1794267905642,"sourceSize":166,"sourcePath":"Characters/Steadfast of the Ackord - The Judge.md","exportPath":"characters/steadfast-of-the-ackord-the-judge.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":13,"backlinks":["characters/npcs/judicious-ackord.html","characters/npcs/magistrate-ackord.html","characters/npcs/worthy-ackord.html"],"type":"markdown"},"things/otash.html":{"title":"Otash","icon":"","description":"A drug made from otari, a southern plant with a pleasant stimulant effect, traditionally made into refreshing tea. Otari grows most commonly in desert oases and cannot normally grow in Stonetop's more northern climbs. It grows tall like bamboo but in flat green blades, looking almost like kelp.Otash is a waxy oil that can be refined from otari by baking at incredibly high heat. Otash wax can be smoked or eaten, though it's often tinctured into strong alcohol to be more palatable (probably most popular method among Stonetop customers, plus it stretches the supply).Otash causes manic euphoria, numbness to pain, loss of impulse control. Long term usage causes mood swings, paranoia, and shakes.","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[],"links":[],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"things/otash.html","pathToRoot":"..","attachments":[],"createdTime":1794269286571,"modifiedTime":1794269482650,"sourceSize":705,"sourcePath":"Things/Otash.md","exportPath":"things/otash.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":15,"backlinks":["characters/river-the-blessed.html"],"type":"markdown"},"things/the-river-king.html":{"title":"The River King","icon":"","description":"","aliases":[],"inlineTags":[],"frontmatterTags":[],"headers":[],"links":[],"author":"","coverImageURL":"","fullURL":"things